        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Free Stylin'",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Collect four profession-gated dungeon patterns and personally craft every required hat.\n\n1. Use a Leatherworker, learn OUTLAND Leatherworking and reach 50 skill. All four hats must be CRAFTED by you for the achievement; buying the finished hats or learning their appearances is insufficient.\n\n2. Farm Pattern: Stylin' Purple Hat (25728) from Blackheart the Inciter in Shadow Labyrinth. Set Normal for repeat attempts and loot the second boss. The pattern is profession-gated, so learn Outland Leatherworking before farming.\n\n3. Farm Pattern: Stylin' Crimson Hat (25731) from Sethekk Ravenguards in Sethekk Halls. Kill and loot the relevant trash rather than rushing only to Anzu or Ikiss.\n\n4. In Old Hillsbrad Foothills, loot Durnholde Riflemen and the associated Rifleman variant for Pattern: Stylin' Adventure Hat (25729). In Black Morass, loot Rift Keepers and Rift Lords during the portal waves for Pattern: Stylin' Jungle Hat (25730). Both instances are inside the Caverns of Time in Tanaris.\n\n5. Learn all four patterns. Bring 24 Heavy Knothide Leather, 8 Cobra Scales, 12 Rune Thread, 8 each of Primal Shadow, Primal Life, Primal Earth and Primal Fire, and 4 each of Purple Dye, Black Dye and Red Dye. Buying the reagents is fine; only the hat crafting must be yours.\n\n6. Craft one Purple, Crimson, Adventure and Jungle hat with Outland Leatherworking. Check all four criteria. Normal and Heroic can drop the patterns, but no first-run drop is guaranteed; replies include players needing many resets.",
